{% block title %}Capsid and other container sources — Capsid Hub{% endblock %}
{% block description %}How Capsid differs from BioContainers, Seqera Containers and StaPH-B, what a container can and cannot do for reproducibility, and a measured comparison of size and security.{% endblock %}
