<header class="page-head">
  <p class="kicker sc">Capsid Hub · Comparison</p>
  <h1>Capsid and other sources of bioinformatics containers</h1>
  <p class="lede">What distinguishes Capsid from BioContainers, Seqera Containers and StaPH-B; what a container
    contributes to reproducibility and replicability, and what it cannot; and a measurement of the same tool
    versions from each source, for size and security.</p>
</header>

